  <header class="intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Green Series · Companion Map</p>
    <h1>From Korti to Khartum</h1>
    <p class="lead">The desert march of January 1885, its camps and wells, the fights at Abu Klea and Abu Kru, and the ascent of the Nile in General Gordon’s steamers — drawn for readers of Sir Charles W. Wilson’s journal.</p>
    <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="viewer">
    <div class="stage" id="stage" aria-label="Map of the desert march and the ascent of the Nile, 1885. Drag to move, scroll or pinch to zoom.">
      <div class="tools">
        <button type="button" id="zin" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
        <button type="button" id="zout" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button>
        <button type="button" id="zreset" aria-label="Show whole map">⤢</button>
      </div>
      <div class="loading" id="loading">Unfolding the map …</div>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/assets/maps/korti-to-khartum/korti-to-khartum-map-A2.pdf" download>Download the map · A2 PDF</a>
